  note "E1-01 · Zbigniew's estate, paid out (tmp/cases/E1/questions.md): as of 2025-06-30, known 2026-01-15. The payouts are D's derivation; e1_01_payouts gives D's amounts and day, e1_01_payouts_to the accounts and arrivals (two asks: one bound variable keys one index, L §2.5); the four checks hold Piotr's and Ania's against what their households state (B-D27, A-D36) and what their accounts show (B's Cis savings export, Ania's Wrzos export), and the deposit against what went in."

